iirc, Mojo being a guaranteed first gift for Valkyries always become  
co-aligned when generated by offering.

That is, a lawful Valk will get a lawful Mojo, and a chaotic Valk will get  
a chaotic Mojo. So no risk of blowing yourself with it.

At least, that's what I understand from  
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/art1-343.html (explanation of the  
'o' in the second table).

